DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
41684::$$$message_0327_0000_0000$$$::"This is a movie poster for a film getting rave reviews at the Fuyuki box office.[br][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01e(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01e(中)] I can't believe they went to all this trouble..."::
41685::$$$message_0327_0001_0000$$$::"Movies are fearsome, are they not?"::
41686::$$$message_0327_0002_0000$$$::"Who are you again?"::
41687::$$$message_0327_0003_0000$$$::"Another movie poster from Fuyuki...[br][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服02e(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=400 storage=凛巫女服02e(中)] That said..."::
41688::$$$message_0327_0004_0000$$$::"It first showed up as part of a nightmarish April Fools' prank.[br][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01c(中)] Some of our newer staff even made hoax pamphlets to give out for Summer Comiket."::
41689::$$$message_0327_0005_0000$$$::"Koume Keito, who handled a portion of the pamphlet visuals, commented, 'I don't really get it, but I'm satisfied that I got to draw cat ears.'"::
41690::$$$message_0327_0006_0000$$$::"He's being tricked. [cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01i(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01i(中)]That's just the creature called Neco-Arc. It's neither cat nor loli, nor does it have ears."::
41691::$$$message_0327_0007_0000$$$::"Hrm...[br]I would like to test my mettle against it someday."::
41692::$$$message_0327_0008_0000$$$::"They even showed this kind of movie.[br][wvl][move textoff=0 spread=1 mx=312 magnify=1 time=200 my=81 path=(318,72,255,1.361)(312,81,255,1) storage=はてなb accel=-2][wm canskip=0] ...Zero?"::
41693::$$$message_0327_0009_0000$$$::"Doesn't it feel more like a trailer to you?"::
41694::$$$message_0327_0010_0000$$$::"They all look rather entertaining.[br]Let us go see a movie sometime."::
41695::$$$message_0327_0011_0000$$$::"Ooh, sure.[br]Let's dress up and go on a date."::

